{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0199ChHFTebistcquLmmxD75","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_7/projects/gen-depth-contamination/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-13\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| exp_003_decoding_ablation | 解码策略调控 K*：不同 top_p/temperature 设置是否改变饱和边界（greedy→更低 K*? 高温度→更高 K*?） | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_013_cross_transfer** (success): Depth signal 是文本固有属性还是 model self-familiarity artifact？4×4 cross-model transfer matrix 测试分类器跨模型泛化能力\\\\n- **exp_005_degradation** (success): —\\\\n  [exp005_degradation_analysis](autodl-4090d:/root/autodl-tmp/gen-depth-contamination/results_exp005_degradation/degradation_analysis.json)\\\\n- **exp_007_bootstrap_ci** (success): K* 统计严谨性验证：bootstrap 95% CI 和 permutation test 确认 K*=2 在三个模型族上统计显著\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 8 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 8\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-4090d: 空闲 cuda:0\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 811, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WmnBroiyF48XyJWst59ack","session_id":"a5ad6c09-3f62-4a50-ac24-2966b7e8297b","uuid":"20483e6d-b8e8-4903-b2f0-e781e2b3a9bc","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:48:08.694Z"}
